            "review_title": "Review at Al Fresco's Phan Xich Long",
            "review_text": "A.J\nHanoi, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nNo parking?\nJun 2019 • Family\nHave been to this location 3-4 times previously. Wife is out of town for a business trip, thought I'd bring my 3 year old for pizza there. Arrive, restaurant seems half full. About 10 motorbikes out front. Am told to park across the busy street. Guy literally pointing across the street and slightly up. Can not figure out where he's pointing. I look again, I've been here when there were twice the amount of motorbikes. Space for some to be moved over. Im not pulling a uturn across a busy street then walking back. I left. Whether it was the parking attendant being lazy, or it actually was policy, it was unacceptable. The food here is passable. Drinks like sodas are expensive, beers are average. Would be a 4 if not for this parking situation. If I get a response from manager I might be more understanding. Have lived here 7+ years, that attendant just didn't want to scootch any bikes over.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 26, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-05",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
